@startuml FLUJO-DATOS
title Flujo de Datos - ThingSpeak → Supabase → UI

skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #1565C0
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #E3F2FD
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #1565C0
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #2E7D32

actor "Usuario" as U
participant "HomePage\n(Ingestion)" as HP
participant "ThingSpeakService" as TSS
participant "ThingSpeak\nAPI REST" as TSA
participant "Supabase\nDatabase" as SDB
participant "MonitorPage\n(Monitoreo)" as MP
participant "MonitorRepository" as MR
participant "MonitorController" as MC

== Ingestión de Datos ==

U -> HP : Presiona "Ingerir últimos"
activate HP
HP -> TSS : ingestLatestFeeds()
activate TSS

TSS -> SDB : getMaxEntryId()\nSELECT entry_id MAX
activate SDB
SDB --> TSS : último entry_id guardado
deactivate SDB

TSS -> TSA : GET /channels/{id}/feeds.json\n?results=20&sort=desc
activate TSA
TSA --> TSS : JSON con feeds[]\n(últimos 20 registros)
deactivate TSA

TSS -> TSS : Filtrar feeds donde\nentry_id > maxSaved
TSS -> TSS : Mapear field1-field8\ny convertir a double

TSS -> SDB : upsert(rows)\nINSERT/UPDATE thingspeak_feed
activate SDB
SDB --> TSS : Confirmación
deactivate SDB

TSS --> HP : {ok: true, inserted: N}
deactivate TSS
HP --> U : Mostrar resultado\n(éxito/error)
deactivate HP

== Consulta de Datos ==

U -> MP : Selecciona rango\nde fechas (Desde/Hasta)
activate MP
MP -> MC : updateDateRange(start, end)
activate MC
MC -> MR : fetchData(startDate, endDate)
activate MR
MR -> SDB : SELECT ts_iso, field1, field2\nFROM thingspeak_feed\nWHERE ts_iso BETWEEN\nstart AND end\nORDER BY ts_iso ASC
activate SDB
SDB --> MR : Lista de registros
deactivate SDB
MR --> MC : List<Map<String, dynamic>>
deactivate MR
MC -> MC : Actualizar estado\nAsyncValue.data(MonitorDataState)
MC --> MP : MonitorDataState\n(filter + data)
deactivate MC

MP -> MP : Renderizar gráficos\nSfCartesianChart
MP --> U : Mostrar gráficos\nde Metano y pH
deactivate MP

== Exportación de Datos ==

U -> MP : Presiona "CSV"
activate MP
MP -> MC : exportToCsv()
activate MC
MC -> MC : Generar CSV:\nTimestamp, Metano, pH
MC -> MC : writeAsString()\nen directorio temporal
MC -> MC : Share.shareXFiles()\nabrir diálogo de\ncompartir
MC --> U : Archivo CSV\ncompartido
deactivate MC
deactivate MP

@enduml
